   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How to read this\nEach box is one page, module, service or step, filled by status (legend, right). Dashed boxes group a layer. Solid arrows = synchronous requests; dashed = async / external traffic.\n\nBranches: main = stable, real AI through AWS Bedrock. google-stack = main + Gemini AI provider, Gmail reply + bounce reading, and sender name / reply-to / signature editing (marked *). Explanation:\ndocs/architecture/README.md. Run it: docs/RUNNING-LOCALLY.md.",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec_16",
   "originalText": "How to read this\nEach box is one page, module, service or step, filled by status (legend, right). Dashed boxes group a layer. Solid arrows = synchronous requests; dashed = async / external traffic.\n\nBranches: main = stable, real AI through AWS Bedrock. google-stack = main + Gemini AI provider, Gmail reply + bounce reading, and sender name / reply-to / signature editing (marked *). Explanation: docs/architecture/README.md. Run it: docs/RUNNING-LOCALLY.md.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
