   "locked": false,
   "text": "sending engine   [DONE]\n30 s tick finds due sends (definer fn) then works per tenant: send\nwindow, daily limit, warm-up 20/50/100 per day, plan caps (defer,\nnot drop), suppression, verified-only senders. Render: variables,\ntracked links, pixel, unsubscribe footer, List-Unsubscribe one-\nclick. Network call outside the DB transaction. Gmail auth failure\n-> retry in 15 min.",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec_126",
   "originalText": "sending engine   [DONE]\n30 s tick finds due sends (definer fn) then works per tenant: send window, daily limit, warm-up 20/50/100 per day, plan caps (defer, not drop), suppression, verified-only senders. Render: variables, tracked links, pixel, unsubscribe footer, List-Unsubscribe one-click. Network call outside the DB transaction. Gmail auth failure -> retry in 15 min.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
