   "text": "PostgreSQL 16  (port 5432)   [DONE]\n46 migrations (0000-0045), run by drizzle-kit as the owner role. RLS on every tenant table.\nTables: orgs, users, memberships, invites, password_resets, refresh_tokens, leads, tags, lead_tags, lead_notes, lead_events, segments,\nsegment_members, import_jobs, sender_accounts, api_keys, template_folders, templates, campaigns, campaign_steps, campaign_leads,\nsent_emails, email_events, suppression_list, conversations, conversation_messages, conversation_notes, notifications, ai_usage,\norg_knowledge, integrations, sheet_syncs, gmail_seen_messages ...",
