   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Needs Aman's accounts / actions   [NOT DONE]\n- Fix system SMTP login (535) -> test reset + notification email\n- Reconnect Gmail with read permission; add Gmail addresses as test users in Google Cloud; live-test reply sync\n- Try a real Google Sheet import + Sync now\n- Public HTTPS URL (cloudflared tunnel) -> re-test opens/clicks\n- AWS account -> file SES request first (2 weeks), Bedrock access (~$200)\n- Sentry DSN; set UPTIME_URL",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec_357",
   "originalText": "Needs Aman's accounts / actions   [NOT DONE]\n- Fix system SMTP login (535) -> test reset + notification email\n- Reconnect Gmail with read permission; add Gmail addresses as test users in Google Cloud; live-test reply sync\n- Try a real Google Sheet import + Sync now\n- Public HTTPS URL (cloudflared tunnel) -> re-test opens/clicks\n- AWS account -> file SES request first (2 weeks), Bedrock access (~$200)\n- Sentry DSN; set UPTIME_URL",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
