   "locked": false,
   "text": "Decisions waiting   [PARTIAL]\n- D-A product name + domain (blocks legal pages, DNS)\n- D-B target market\n- D-C hosting (then deploy T10.4)\n- D-D beta size + channel\n- Email verification at sign-up\n- Legal review of /privacy + /terms, DPA, sub-processors\n- Merge google-stack into main? (Gemini, reply sync, sender edit)",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec_359",
   "originalText": "Decisions waiting   [PARTIAL]\n- D-A product name + domain (blocks legal pages, DNS)\n- D-B target market\n- D-C hosting (then deploy T10.4)\n- D-D beta size + channel\n- Email verification at sign-up\n- Legal review of /privacy + /terms, DPA, sub-processors\n- Merge google-stack into main? (Gemini, reply sync, sender edit)",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
