   "updated": 1763510400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Security before public launch   [NOT DONE]\n- 2FA for admins + managers\n- Per-account login throttling\n- Email verification at sign-up\n- Private DB/Redis networking, Redis TLS + password\n- Least-privilege AWS IAM\n- Audit log of sensitive actions\n- Encryption-key rotation plan\n- Dependabot + NestJS 12 upgrade, Next.js advisory\n- Strict CSP with nonces",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec_361",
   "originalText": "Security before public launch   [NOT DONE]\n- 2FA for admins + managers\n- Per-account login throttling\n- Email verification at sign-up\n- Private DB/Redis networking, Redis TLS + password\n- Least-privilege AWS IAM\n- Audit log of sensitive actions\n- Encryption-key rotation plan\n- Dependabot + NestJS 12 upgrade, Next.js advisory\n- Strict CSP with nonces",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
