   "updated": 1763510400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-off: one API process runs HTTP, websockets and every worker. Simple to run and deploy today; split workers into\ntheir own service when send volume grows (JOBS_SCHEDULER=off on extra web instances).",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec_371",
   "originalText": "Trade-off: one API process runs HTTP, websockets and every worker. Simple to run and deploy today; split workers into their own service when send volume grows (JOBS_SCHEDULER=off on extra web instances).",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
